<section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-intro"><div><p class="micro">The game plan</p><h2 class="section-h" id="how-h">Three steps. You're in.</h2></div><p class="body">Made for the afternoons when your team kicks off and your to-do list doesn't stop.</p></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Pick your side.</h3><p>Sign in to the Mac app and choose <a href="/teams/">your favourite teams</a>, or follow a whole <a href="/leagues/">football league</a>.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Set your matchday.</h3><p>Choose the alerts you want, pick your screen, and pin a match to keep the score in sight.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Get on with your day.</h3><p>The moments come to you. See how notch alerts and goal celebrations work in the <a href="/#demo">app demo</a>.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
